https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/minchen333_1773894730_3856030451035623455_202698442_15477049146a97a410dcd32-1024x1365.jpg\"/><figcaption>林明禎日本遊學 （圖片來源：IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林明禎日本遊學 （圖片來源：IG@minchen333）\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/minchen333_1773894730_3856029269751857706_202698442_10096059356a97a413381d0-1024x1365.jpg\"/><figcaption>林明禎日本遊學 （圖片來源：IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林明禎日本遊學 （圖片來源：IG@minchen333）\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/minchen333_1783948693_3940369467896990407_202698442_10390118216a97a415e9d08-1024x1365.jpg\"/><figcaption>林明禎日本遊學 （圖片來源：IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林明禎日本遊學 （圖片來源：IG@minchen333）\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/minchen333_1786280303_3959928498898373950_202698442_14943927836a97a41896478-1024x1365.jpg\"/><figcaption>林明禎日本遊學 （圖片來源：IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林明禎日本遊學 （圖片來源：IG@minchen333）\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/minchen333_1786280303_3959928470276542059_202698442_16366415306a97a41be3f15-1024x1365.jpg\"/><figcaption>林明禎日本遊學 （圖片來源：IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure><p>林明禎是否已經退出娛樂圈移居日本？</p><p>雖然林明禎近日公開了在日本遊學及新居的生活片段，加上她過往曾透露有意在東京開酒吧，因而引發隱退揣測，但退出娛樂圈的傳聞至今尚未獲當事人證實。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T04:44:03.342530+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1326,"images":17,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}